---
import IconLocal from '~/components/atoms/IconLocal.astro';
---

<section id="local-first" class="relative max-w-6xl mx-auto mb-16 overflow-hidden">
	<div>
	
		<div class="p-4 sm:p-6 lg:p-8">
			<div class="flex flex-wrap md:-mx-8">
				<div class="w-full lg:w-1/2 px-0 sm:px-8">
					<div class="mb-8">
						<h2 class="mb-8 text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold font-heading">
							Core Principles
						</h2>

						<p class="mb-8 text-xl text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">
							Privacy by Architecture means designing your system, or homelab, so that tools and data run on your own hardware. 
							Your machine becomes the center of your network, not a node in someone else’s cloud.
						</p>
						<p class="mb-8 text-xl text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">
							Autonomy is the antidote to the invisible strings of social engineering baked into proprietary tools. 
							By building on open-source foundations, you own the process and the output, pure utility, designed for creative mastery.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="w-full lg:w-1/2 p-4">
					<ul class="space-y-12">
						<li class="flex md:-mx-4">
							<div class="pr-4 sm:pl-4">
								<span
									class="flex w-16 h-16 mx-auto items-center justify-center text-2xl font-bold rounded-full bg-radial-[at_50%_25%] from-orange-800 via-red-950 to-zinc-900 to-90% text-white"
								>
									1</span
								>
							</div>
							<div class="px-4">
								<h5 class="mb-4 text-xl font-semibold font-heading">Sovereignty</h5>
								<p class="text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
									No surprise bills. Replace cloud lock-in with open-source tools that run on your hardware, on your own terms.
								</p>
							</div>
						</li>
						<li class="flex md:-mx-4">
							<div class="pr-4 sm:pl-4">
								<span
									class="flex w-16 h-16 mx-auto items-center justify-center text-2xl font-bold rounded-full bg-radial-[at_50%_25%] from-orange-800 via-red-950 to-zinc-900 to-90% text-white"
								>
									2</span
								>
							</div>
							<div class="px-4">
								<h5 class="mb-4 text-xl font-semibold font-heading">Mobility</h5>
								<p class="text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
									Work anywhere, offline or online. Your environment stays consistent across devices, with sync only when you decide.
								</p>
							</div>
						</li>
						<li class="flex md:-mx-4">
							<div class="pr-4 sm:pl-4">
								<span
									class="flex w-16 h-16 mx-auto items-center justify-center text-2xl font-bold rounded-full bg-radial-[at_50%_25%] from-orange-800 via-red-950 to-zinc-900 to-90% text-white"
								>
									3</span
								>
							</div>
							<div class="px-4">
								<h5 class="mb-4 text-xl font-semibold font-heading">Resilience</h5>
								<p class="text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
									Restore your setup in minutes from a USB drive or private Git repo. Safely share a local server using a tunneling service.
								</p>
							</div>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		
		<div class="absolute -z-10 inset-0 h-full w-full bg-[radial-gradient(circle,#73737350_1px,transparent_1px)] bg-[size:10px_10px] [mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse_50%_50%_at_50%_50%,#000_80%,transparent_100%)]" />
	</div>
</section>
